{"id":"hierba","lemma":"hierba","pos":"noun","rank":1788,"glosses":["grass (plant of the family Poaceae or plant that resembles grasses)","herb (plant used to flavour food)","herb (plant used in medicine)"],"ipa":"/ˈʝeɾba/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"hierbas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-hierba.wav","examples":[{"text":"Los caballos comen hierba.","en":"Horses eat grass.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/80540"},{"text":"Nuestro jardín estaba lleno de malas hierbas.","en":"Our garden was full of weeds.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641718"},{"text":"Sentémonos en la hierba.","en":"Let's sit on the grass.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/47454"},{"text":"Las malas hierbas se hicieron con el jardín.","en":"Weeds sprang up in the garden.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704182"},{"text":"Las vacas están comiendo hierba.","en":"The cows are eating grass.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/517907"}]}